            mmArticlesKicker:"Spend the remaining dots well", mmWhyKicker:"Why we built this", mmWhyTitle:"You will spend roughly <em>4,000 weeks</em> here. The stoics kept this truth close — not to darken the day, but to sharpen it. Every dot is a question: is this how I want to spend one month of a finite life?",
            psychKicker:"PSYCHOLOGY", psychTitle:"The Psychology of <em>Discipline</em>", psychSubtitle:"Understand the science behind habits, motivation, and mindset. Why we do what we do — and how to change it.",
