            habitAffiliateHeading:"Affiliate Disclosure:", habitAffiliateText:"As an Amazon Associate, we earn from qualifying purchases made through the Amazon links on this page. The price you pay is unchanged. We only recommend books we've personally read and found genuinely valuable — never paid placements.", habitAffiliateLink:"Read our full disclosure policy →",
